WEBVTT

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.810
My right eye pains me so...

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:10.250
Miguel's power grows stronger by the day.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:14.980
But I must complete the project!

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:16.860
Lend me your aid...

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:20.280
Lend me your aid, Gestöber!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:41.350
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.430
<b>School Results</b>

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.430
<b>Koyuki Seri</b>

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.430
<b>Usami Cultural

00:01:54.460 --> 00:01:58.430
<b>Doomed

00:01:58.630 --> 00:02:03.100
<b><i>Delusion 8</i></b>

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:00.780
<i>This is because of all the 
time I spent with them!</i>

00:02:00.780 --> 00:02:03.260
<i>But that's over now! 
I'll never react to them again!</i>

00:02:03.260 --> 00:02:05.230
Check it out, Gestöber!

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:08.890
<i>I'll never react to their crap again.</i>

00:02:08.890 --> 00:02:10.580
<i>I'll just swat any flies I see.</i>

00:02:10.580 --> 00:02:13.540
Didn't that count as reacting, Seri-kun?

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:15.900
<i>Yeah, yeah. I know, I know.</i>

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:19.520
<i>Every time I've said I'll never
call out Hanadori-kun again,</i>

00:02:19.520 --> 00:02:21.630
<i>it doesn't work out.</i>

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:22.700
<i>But...</i>

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:32.170
<b>How to Talk to People</b>

00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:32.170
<b>How to Keep 
Any Schedule</b>

00:02:22.950 --> 00:02:25.340
<i>After all the studying I've 
been doing for my tests,</i>

00:02:25.340 --> 00:02:28.200
<i>I've learned to develop 
my latent subconscious.</i>

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.240
Are you waiting for someone 
to call you out, Seri-kun?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:32.170
<i>I'm redefining what it means
 to call someone out!</i>

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:35.500
School
Newspaper

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:35.500
<b>Student Council
 Elections</b>

00:02:32.330 --> 00:02:35.500
I, Sturmhut, am running for 
student council president!

00:02:35.720 --> 00:02:38.290
Look! Check it out, Gestöber!

00:02:38.870 --> 00:02:41.360
<i>Not a word from me. Do whatever you want.</i>

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.340
How to Talk to People

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:43.540
Koyukichi-dono!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:47.930
<b>Mogami 
Kimikage</b>

00:02:43.540 --> 00:02:47.150
I heard Kabu-dono was running,
so I entered the race, as well.

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:49.650
What a terrible sin!
Must I be punished for it?

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:49.650
<i>Not a word from me.</i>

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.280
Since there were so many entrants,
 I joined in too, just for fun!

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:57.660
Tsukimiya Utsugi!
Please vote for Tsukimiya Utsugi!

00:02:56.330 --> 00:02:57.660
<i>Not a word...</i>

00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.870
I'm only a first-year, but I'm running, too.

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:03.460
I'm hoping I can support
Miguel-senpai's campaign.

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:05.700
Oh, Helius! That's so nice of you!

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.620
<i>Not a single word out of m—</i>

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.840
Oh! And of course, I entered you too, Seri-kun!

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>I'm running!</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>I'm running!</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>I'm running!</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>I'm running!</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>Seri Koyuki</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>Seri Koyuki</b>

00:03:10.540 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>Seri Koyuki</b>

00:03:10.840 --> 00:03:11.640
Look!

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.300
I put up all these posters!

00:03:13.190 --> 00:03:13.630
<b>Seri Koyuki</b>

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:14.980
Gestöber!

00:03:14.980 --> 00:03:16.600
Koyukichi-dono!

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:21.200
<b>I'm running!</b>

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:21.260
<i>The date: just before the
student council election.</i>

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:21.280
<b>Koyuki Seri</b>

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:23.680
<i>Damn it all!</i>

00:03:23.680 --> 00:03:26.620
<i>I don't have time to be
on the student council.</i>

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:28.710
<i>Damn it...</i>

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:33.350
<b>Science Room</b>

00:03:28.710 --> 00:03:30.560
<i>How can I get some time to myself?</i>

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.710
<i>How can I get some peace?</i>

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:34.460
<i>I know!</i>

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:35.960
<i>I'll just poison them.</i>

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:38.560
<i>Enough to knock them out for a week.</i>

00:03:38.560 --> 00:03:40.280
Where is Utsugi-sama?

00:03:40.490 --> 00:03:42.430
What are you doing, Koyuki Seri?

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.340
<i>What </i>was<i> I doing, actually?</i>

00:03:45.340 --> 00:03:47.200
You seem quite troubled.

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:49.270
That's why I warned you.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:50.660
Shut up.

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:55.260
If you can't do anything on your own,
 ask Utsugi-sama for help.

00:03:52.920 --> 00:03:55.250
<b>The Truth of the Universe</b>

00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:57.920
What? I can't do that.

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:03.380
<b>The Truth of the Universe</b>

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:03.380
<b>Tsukimiya Utsugi</b>

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:01.290
He gets off on seeing me miserable.

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.380
Have you ever actually asked him?

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:05.560
Or are you just making assumptions?

00:04:05.560 --> 00:04:06.610
Well...

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:09.900
Get down on your knees and lick his boots.

00:04:09.900 --> 00:04:11.690
No way in hell!

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.530
Now, let's go.

00:04:13.530 --> 00:04:14.410
<i>Jeez...</i>

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:25.800
Climb up and get this poster, Koyuki Se—

00:04:26.240 --> 00:04:27.300
Oh?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.500
I hear you've come to lick my boots...

00:04:33.660 --> 00:04:37.160
All joking aside... Sure, I'll help you out.

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:40.940
I can just tell Hanadori-kun that you 
weren't brothers in arms in a past life.

00:04:40.940 --> 00:04:41.960
Wait, for real?

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:43.660
You sure that's what you want, though?

00:04:43.660 --> 00:04:45.580
He might take it pretty hard.

00:04:45.580 --> 00:04:48.420
Well, that was your fault to begin with...

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:49.680
Gestöber!

00:04:49.680 --> 00:04:52.450
Hey! I need your help with something!

00:04:52.450 --> 00:04:53.710
Gestöber!

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.250
See? He's calling for you now.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.040
And I know you won't 
have the heart to tell him.

00:04:55.250 --> 00:04:58.280
Hey! Where are you?

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:59.600
I-I will, too!

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.110
<i>I don't care what kind of 
life Hanadori-kun lives,</i>

00:05:02.110 --> 00:05:04.110
<i>but I have my own future.</i>

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:06.370
<i>So I need him to accept that...</i>

00:05:07.580 --> 00:05:09.180
So you see, Hanadori,

00:05:09.180 --> 00:05:12.840
Seri-kun hasn't the slightest
intention of helping you, he says.

00:05:13.130 --> 00:05:15.000
H-Hanadori-kun?

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:17.710
<i>He froze. What should I do?</i>

00:05:17.970 --> 00:05:19.400
Listen, Hanadori.

00:05:19.400 --> 00:05:22.300
Seri-kun isn't the Hierophant of Ice.

00:05:22.580 --> 00:05:26.790
He's the one who sealed Miguel within you...

00:05:26.790 --> 00:05:30.140
Gestöber, the Director of Darkness!

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:34.930
He's the cause of all your suffering!

00:05:35.200 --> 00:05:36.670
<i>You cunning asshole!</i>

00:05:36.670 --> 00:05:38.910
<i>I really thought you were going to help!</i>

00:05:38.910 --> 00:05:40.940
<i>You're the cause of all </i>my<i> suffering!</i>

00:05:41.490 --> 00:05:43.090
Th-That's impossible!

00:05:43.090 --> 00:05:44.620
Tsukimiya, you're a liar!

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:49.210
Hanadori-kun...

00:05:50.610 --> 00:05:52.420
There sure are a lot of candidates.

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.540
<i>Why did he believe Tsukimiya
 when he told him</i>

00:05:53.540 --> 00:05:55.320
<i>we were brothers in arms, but not now?</i>

00:05:59.710 --> 00:06:06.670
<b>Student Council Election Speeches</b>

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:05.620
The candidates for student council
will now give their speeches.

00:06:05.620 --> 00:06:08.740
U-Um, I withdrew from the race.

00:06:08.740 --> 00:06:09.640
Why am I here?

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:11.360
Oh, who cares, Seri-kun?

00:06:11.360 --> 00:06:12.460
It's more fun this way.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:13.600
Right, Hanadori?

00:06:16.320 --> 00:06:18.080
Oh, dear...

00:06:18.080 --> 00:06:21.880
<i>Hanadori-kun must've taken it pretty hard.</i>

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.270
<i>He's been really quiet the past few days.</i>

00:06:24.560 --> 00:06:28.620
<i>He hasn't been bothering me like usual, 
and he's been avoiding Tsukimiya-kun, too.</i>

00:06:28.620 --> 00:06:31.750
<i>He hasn't been shouting "Gwah!"
in the middle of class, either.</i>

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:35.080
<i>I know this is what I wanted,
but it's still somehow...</i>

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.080
<i>No, this isn't quite what I wanted.</i>

00:06:38.080 --> 00:06:41.750
Student council president candidate
Hanadori Kabuto-kun of Class 2-3.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.680
<i>What did he want my help with, anyway?</i>

00:06:54.840 --> 00:06:56.680
Isn't that the dark god of destruction?

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:59.020
Miguel-senpai...

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:00.150
<i>Hanadori-kun?</i>

00:07:03.980 --> 00:07:08.060
I wanted to change things 
here at this school.

00:07:08.480 --> 00:07:12.040
I wanted to make it a place for those
 who've lost sight of their goals.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:15.840
For those who aren't confident they
can be the people they want to be.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.240
For those who are so awkward
that things never work out.

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:21.460
A place where everyone can strive 
to be who they want to be.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:24.420
A place where we can all be friends.

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.590
<i>Huh? He's actually sounding normal.</i>

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:29.360
<i>What happened to Hanadori-kun?</i>

00:07:29.360 --> 00:07:31.630
<i>Did the shock ruin his act?</i>

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:37.240
But I couldn't bring about
this utopia on... my own...

00:07:40.740 --> 00:07:42.180
<i>He's back to his old self.</i>

00:07:43.090 --> 00:07:45.640
I can feel it, Sturmhut...

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.900
The darkness in your heart.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.250
<i>What happened to you?</i>

00:07:49.250 --> 00:07:51.320
<i>Why are you bringing out Miguel
in front of the school?</i>

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:52.660
Stop it, Miguel!

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.700
I haven't given up yet!

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.900
<i>You're not gonna be 
student council president now!</i>

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:06.080
<b>S H O C K</b>

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:08.550
<i>Yeah, of course they're all slack-jawed.</i>

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.530
<i>What are you doing?
What are you thinking, Hanadori-kun?</i>

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:13.480
<i>I'm not saying a word to you, though!</i>

00:08:13.480 --> 00:08:14.260
Gestöber!

00:08:14.760 --> 00:08:18.500
I don't know how much longer
I can hold Miguel back.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.570
So before that happens, tell me...

00:08:21.570 --> 00:08:24.880
Are you Gestöber, Hierophant of Ice,

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:27.290
or Gestöber, Director of Darkness?

00:08:27.290 --> 00:08:30.400
Who will you choose, Sturmhut or Miguel?

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:34.080
Show me your answer with your vote!

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.070
<b>Miguel</b>

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.070
<b>Sturmhut</b>

00:08:34.610 --> 00:08:37.240
They're both you!

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:38.190
This is stupid!

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:40.060
How come I don't get a real vote?

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:42.750
Why am I only allowed to vote for you?

00:08:42.750 --> 00:08:44.710
Look at how everybody's whispering!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:46.210
Now cut it out and...

00:08:46.210 --> 00:08:47.520
<i>Crap.</i>

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.800
<i>Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.590
<i>Oh, no! Did I hit him too hard?</i>

00:08:56.810 --> 00:08:59.430
<i>No, this is just part of the act, right?</i>

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:00.550
Hana—

00:09:03.330 --> 00:09:04.290
Miguel-senpai!

00:09:03.810 --> 00:09:04.720
Hanadori!

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:05.970
Kabu-dono, wake up!

00:09:05.970 --> 00:09:08.060
Miguel-senpai, wake up!

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:10.500
Hanadori! Hanadori!

00:09:10.500 --> 00:09:11.830
Hanadori-kun?

00:09:14.440 --> 00:09:19.220
<i>In those days, the dark god of
destruction was always by my side.</i>

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:24.170
<i>I was always so busy
thinking about tomorrow</i>

00:09:24.170 --> 00:09:27.730
<i>that I didn't understand the guy who 
always treated me like an old friend.</i>

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:29.800
<i>I didn't know what to do.</i>

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:36.130
<i>And then I caused a terrible tragedy.</i>

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:38.740
<i>I'm sorry, Hanadori-kun.</i>

00:09:38.740 --> 00:09:41.220
<i>Only after losing you do I understand...</i>

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:43.850
You are my dearest friend!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.560
Knock it the hell off!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.560
<b>S</b>

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.560
<b>H</b>

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.560
<b>O</b>

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.560
<b>C</b>

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.560
<b>K</b>

00:09:43.950 --> 00:09:46.560
<b>Student Council Election Speeches</b>

00:09:50.400 --> 00:09:52.600
He's fine. Just sleeping.

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:55.800
Not sure if it was stress or lack of sleep, but he was pretty exhausted.

00:09:55.800 --> 00:09:58.620
Then he hit his head
and it knocked him out.

00:09:58.880 --> 00:10:02.080
Maybe he just worked that hard on his speech.

00:10:05.920 --> 00:10:08.850
<i>It feels like he was actually
really serious about it.</i>

00:10:08.850 --> 00:10:10.900
<i>Why did he care so much?</i>

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:14.740
H-Hanadori-kun!

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:18.440
Miguel-senpai, I'm so glad you're awake!

00:10:18.440 --> 00:10:20.020
Do you hurt anywhere?

00:10:24.180 --> 00:10:25.550
U-Um...

00:10:25.550 --> 00:10:29.100
I'm sorry, but where are my glasses?

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:32.270
Without my glasses...

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:34.100
I can't really see out of my right eye.

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:36.020
<i>What's gotten into him?</i>

00:10:36.020 --> 00:10:37.540
<i>His glasses?</i>

00:10:37.540 --> 00:10:39.920
<i>He can't see out his right eye
 because of his eyepatch!</i>

00:10:41.400 --> 00:10:42.600
Oh, here they are!

00:10:42.600 --> 00:10:44.090
<i>Don't take the nurse's!</i>

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:46.360
Good.

00:10:46.360 --> 00:10:48.170
Now I'm back to normal.

00:10:48.340 --> 00:10:51.020
Without my glasses, I'm just not myself.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:54.290
<i>You're hardly yourself right now.</i>

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.600
<i>What's gotten into you?</i>

00:10:55.600 --> 00:10:58.100
<i>You're wearing glasses over an eyepatch.</i>

00:10:58.100 --> 00:10:59.220
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:10:59.610 --> 00:11:01.090
<i>What happened?</i>

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:03.550
Hanadori, do you know who this is?

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:12.160
What's wrong?

00:11:12.160 --> 00:11:13.740
Your hair's sticking up.

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:16.160
Want to borrow my conditioner?

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.400
<i>I will kill you.</i>

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:19.440
<i></i>You're<i> what's wrong!</i>

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:20.870
<i>What's with this new act?</i>

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.130
<i>I don't get it at all!</i>

00:11:22.130 --> 00:11:25.800
M-Miguel-senpai, are you sure
you didn't hit your head?

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:29.590
Who is this person? He's scary!

00:11:29.590 --> 00:11:32.240
That outfit! That frightening weapon!

00:11:32.240 --> 00:11:33.800
He's not normal!

00:11:34.590 --> 00:11:36.750
N-No...

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.720
Miguel-senpai, you jerk!

00:11:41.580 --> 00:11:43.400
<i>He's turned into a real god of destruction...</i>

00:11:44.730 --> 00:11:45.960
Hibiki-kun!

00:11:45.960 --> 00:11:48.540
What's going on? I'm really scared.

00:11:49.670 --> 00:11:53.140
Have you grown out of your 
beep-boop talk, Kabu-dono?

00:11:53.140 --> 00:11:54.270
Good to see.

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:57.480
You're in high school now 
and far too old for that.

00:11:58.180 --> 00:11:59.890
I don't understand why I'm hearing this

00:11:59.890 --> 00:12:04.070
from a boy who wears a cape and 
a scary Japanese mask to school.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.860
Aren't you embarrassed?

00:12:05.860 --> 00:12:07.260
<i>He said it to his face!</i>

00:12:07.260 --> 00:12:09.810
<i>Hanadori-kun, what's gotten into you?</i>

00:12:10.070 --> 00:12:15.250
I-I didn't get my laundry done, so I'm just 
wearing some old clothes... That's all.

00:12:15.250 --> 00:12:16.680
<i>I'm calling bullshit.</i>

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:18.720
<i>You're both embarrassing
as far as I'm concerned.</i>

00:12:19.900 --> 00:12:21.950
Maybe he has amnesia?

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:26.040
Seri-kun hit him in the head
with a microphone, right?

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.560
Maybe the impact did it.

00:12:27.860 --> 00:12:29.520
Th-That can't be!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:33.100
He was just fine after a crash
that knocked me clean out.

00:12:30.680 --> 00:12:31.640
<b>Slam</b>

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:37.370
But you know, he wasn't feeling well today.

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:41.150
Maybe getting hit again
will turn him back to normal.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.780
