00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:19.320
Now do you remember who 
you just spoke out against?

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:24.190
Awful! Scary! How barbaric!

00:13:24.190 --> 00:13:27.240
Are all the students at this school like that?

00:13:27.240 --> 00:13:29.440
That's right... The student council!

00:13:29.440 --> 00:13:32.200
I wanted to be on the student council...

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:34.500
to make this a better school!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:35.700
That's why I...

00:13:35.960 --> 00:13:37.000
<i>Did he remember?</i>

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:38.370
That's right.

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:40.950
Even the most worthless 
of lives still has value.

00:13:40.950 --> 00:13:45.100
Even people like them are 
still students of this school.

00:13:45.100 --> 00:13:46.930
I have to do something!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.640
I have a lot to do, so I'll be going!

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.100
Who are you calling worthless?!

00:13:52.610 --> 00:13:54.420
That didn't work.

00:13:54.420 --> 00:13:58.670
But he was talking about wanting to
change the school during his speech, too.

00:13:58.670 --> 00:14:01.640
He must've really wanted to do something.

00:14:02.520 --> 00:14:05.490
<b>The Next Day</b>

00:14:02.810 --> 00:14:05.490
<i>Um... Attention, everyone.</i>

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:08.900
<i>I'm sorry for surprising you 
during my speech yesterday.</i>

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.790
<i>I was a little too tense.</i>

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.730
<i>As I said yesterday,</i>

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:16.660
<i>I want to make this school
a better place for everyone.</i>

00:14:13.740 --> 00:14:15.860
That's Hanadori, isn't it?

00:14:16.680 --> 00:14:20.020
<i>I want you all to make good memories here.</i>

00:14:20.380 --> 00:14:23.620
That's not my Hanadori at all.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:24.840
It's boring.

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:30.580
He received a new destiny as Sturmhut,
but he still won't believe it.

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:35.580
<i>Maybe he's happier this way.</i>

00:14:36.540 --> 00:14:41.120
<i>It's perfect for me that he's avoiding me, but...</i>

00:14:41.120 --> 00:14:42.990
<i>That's exactly what I wanted, but...</i>

00:14:43.480 --> 00:14:46.270
<i>If he lost his memory because of me...</i>

00:14:46.270 --> 00:14:48.740
<i>That just doesn't feel right.</i>

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:52.090
So you're lonely too, huh?

00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.340
N-No!

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:55.030
Don't steal my lunch!

00:14:55.030 --> 00:14:56.360
Also...

