<b>Mumble</b>

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:10.550
Tell me.

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:12.000
Tell me... Why?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:16.010
<b>Why?\h\h\hWhy?

00:15:10.550 --> 00:15:16.010
<b>Why?\h\h\hWhy?

00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:16.020
Why? Why? Why?

00:15:12.540 --> 00:15:15.590
<i>Scary... Hibiki-kun, you're being scary!</i>

00:15:19.280 --> 00:15:22.310
Kabu-dono seems to have dropped out.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:24.760
How long will he last?

00:15:25.010 --> 00:15:26.740
Not that it's my problem.

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:28.320
Now, Koyukichi-dono,

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:32.060
scold me for wearing 
my old clothes yesterday.

00:15:32.060 --> 00:15:34.220
While the oni's away, the mice will play.

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:35.360
<i>You're the oni!</i>

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:38.330
<i>Knock it off with the sword and 
the heart eyes! Stay in character!</i>

00:15:43.560 --> 00:15:45.920
<i>Sure, I don't want anything to do with him...</i>

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:48.250
<i>How barbaric!</i>

00:15:49.640 --> 00:15:52.510
<i>I'm not lonely. I'm mad!</i>

00:15:52.510 --> 00:15:54.130
<i>Yeah, maybe this is my fault,</i>

00:15:54.130 --> 00:15:56.780
<i>but why do I have to feel bad on his part?</i>

00:15:55.390 --> 00:16:01.230
<b>Grrr

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:58.700
<i>He's the barbaric one...</i>

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:01.220
<i>always raging on about 
"Gestöber this" and "Gestöber that"!</i>

00:16:01.220 --> 00:16:03.230
Check it out, Gestöber!

00:16:03.230 --> 00:16:05.860
I need your help with something! Gestöber!

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:09.360
<i>What was so important to him?</i>

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.360
<i>Hanadori-kun?!</i>

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.960
The dark god of destruction,
Miguel, has revived!

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:17.980
Oh, damn! He's back!

00:16:18.370 --> 00:16:23.710
<b>G\h\hr\h\hr\h\hr\h\hr\h\hr</b>

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:19.840
So what does Miguel do then?

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:21.430
Revives the darkness, maybe?

00:16:21.690 --> 00:16:23.710
What does that even mean?

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:26.870
<i>Jeez! I thought he'd gotten his memory back!</i>

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:29.730
Hey, it's the former Miguel!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.510
Why are you so serious all of a sudden?

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:35.850
Worried about what people think? 
Seems a little late for that.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.730
Wh-Who are you people?

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:40.620
I took Miguel from you, actually.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:44.680
You gave up the act, so you don't 
need that eyepatch anymore, right?

00:16:44.680 --> 00:16:47.410
Give it to me! I need to seal away Miguel!

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.900
Why am I even wearing this?

00:16:49.900 --> 00:16:53.120
Who cares? You forgot, right?

00:16:53.480 --> 00:16:56.210
If you want it, you can have it.

00:16:56.780 --> 00:16:58.090
Seriously?

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:01.780
What are you doing?

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.040
W-Well...

00:17:03.040 --> 00:17:05.980
I don't need it, but I just can't
give it up for some reason.

00:17:06.460 --> 00:17:07.510
What is that?

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:09.100
Your new backstory?

00:17:09.100 --> 00:17:11.950
Why? I can't remember...

00:17:12.600 --> 00:17:14.480
Maybe it was really expensive!

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:16.060
Like 8,500 yen?

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:17.450
<i>You know that's wrong.</i>

00:17:16.060 --> 00:17:18.200
Or maybe it's part of an important memory...

00:17:18.200 --> 00:17:20.060
Hey, your buddy's here!

00:17:20.760 --> 00:17:22.730
Maybe he has some answers.

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:25.690
What's with Hanadori?
He's acting weird today.

00:17:25.920 --> 00:17:27.340
You're his buddy, right?

00:17:27.340 --> 00:17:29.220
You know, the one with the weird name...

00:17:29.220 --> 00:17:30.980
I-I'm not his buddy.

00:17:30.980 --> 00:17:33.700
Huh? That's a harsh thing to say to Miguel.

00:17:34.480 --> 00:17:36.340
You mean the <i>former</i> Miguel.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:39.290
<i>No, Hanadori-kun's just ignoring me.</i>

00:17:39.290 --> 00:17:40.630
<i>I'm sure now...</i>

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:53.980
Hana...

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:56.800
Aww, you made him cry!

00:17:57.160 --> 00:17:59.010
What? How odd...

00:17:59.010 --> 00:18:01.160
Strange liquid is seeping from my eyes. Why?

00:18:01.160 --> 00:18:03.090
Don't cry, former Miguel.

00:18:04.360 --> 00:18:06.690
<i>Because I said I wasn't his buddy?</i>

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:10.610
Seri-kun is Gestöber, Director of Darkness!

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:12.910
He's the cause of all your suffering!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:15.210
Tsukimiya, you're a liar!

00:18:16.440 --> 00:18:20.130
<i>Has that been bugging him this whole time?</i>

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:22.970
I'm sick of this.

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:27.040
The little things, the things 
you have no evidence of...

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:29.120
Don't worry about all that stuff!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:32.270
It's annoying when you keep
obsessing over it and going crazy!

00:18:32.980 --> 00:18:35.360
I'm not your buddy.

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:36.990
I hate to say it,

00:18:36.990 --> 00:18:41.380
but for a long time now,
 you and I have been...

00:18:41.400 --> 00:18:44.330
No, I mean... We're not friends, right?

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:46.140
We just met yesterday.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:50.690
And I don't want to be associated
with people like you, I don't think...

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.690
<b><i>Smash!</i></b>

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:52.690
Screw you!

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.200
My glasses!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:18:59.160
That's so mean!

00:18:59.160 --> 00:19:01.660
What was that for, Gestöber?

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.620
How could you do that to Sturmhut?

00:19:03.860 --> 00:19:07.240
Jeez! I'm super mad, you hear me?

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:08.360
Just kidding!

00:19:10.330 --> 00:19:12.620
H-He's back?

00:19:12.620 --> 00:19:14.250
What's wrong, guys?

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:15.700
What's gotten into all of you?

00:19:16.440 --> 00:19:19.240
Were you worried about me being down?

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:20.960
I'm so glad, Miguel-senpai!

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.020
It was all a misunderstanding, wasn't it?

00:19:23.020 --> 00:19:26.540
As the grim reaper,
I'll stay by your side forever!

00:19:24.530 --> 00:19:26.920
How dull.

00:19:30.730 --> 00:19:33.100
<i>So what was that all about, anyway?</i>

00:19:33.100 --> 00:19:36.710
<i>Can someone really change so much
over losing a few memories?</i>

00:19:37.160 --> 00:19:40.400
<i>What if he has another,
weirder personality tomorrow?</i>

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:44.160
Seri-kun, don't sweat the small stuff.

00:19:44.160 --> 00:19:46.160
<i>I wish you would worry a lot more.</i>

00:19:46.160 --> 00:19:49.620
Here. This is the student council 
plan Hanadori wrote up.

00:19:49.940 --> 00:19:54.800
If you read it, you might understand
what he wanted to talk to you about.

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Ask Gestöber for help

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Menukoroirya

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Mascot Character
 (Ask Tsukimiya?)

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Menukoroirya study group
 (somewhere)

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Japanese

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Friend-Making Support Group

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
So that guys like Helius
 can make friends

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Wow!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Mitoya

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
(Gestöber)

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Lots of fun!!

00:19:55.460 --> 00:20:00.420
Amazing 
club
 activities

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:02.330
<i>What was he worried about?</i>

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:09.850
...wanted to lend(?) borrow.
Gestöber is my enemy...?
 Is that really right? 

00:20:03.540 --> 00:20:06.650
<i>I couldn't possibly help him with this.</i>

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.860
<i>I've got my own problems!</i>

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:13.310
<b>But Gestöber is Gestöber. 
I know that he's kind.</b>

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:17.380
<i>"If something happens to me, 
I know he'll help me again."</i>

00:20:17.380 --> 00:20:22.620
<i>"So if something's bothering Gestöber,
I want to help him."</i>

00:20:23.780 --> 00:20:26.490
<b><i>Slam</i></b>

00:20:23.920 --> 00:20:26.490
<i>You're what's bothering me! You!</i>

00:20:26.490 --> 00:20:28.530
Wh-What's wrong, Gestöber?

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:30.830
If you want to talk, I'm all ears.

00:20:33.130 --> 00:20:33.990
<i>But...</i>

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:42.720
<i>But I don't want the Hanadori-kun
I know to just disappear.</i>

00:20:42.720 --> 00:20:44.420
<i>In some weird way.</i>

00:20:45.250 --> 00:20:48.080
<i>I'm relieved, but also disappointed.</i>

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:49.380
<i>But in any case,</i>

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:52.080
<i>I'm sure things will be back
 to normal tomorrow.</i>

00:20:52.080 --> 00:20:55.730
Why don't you just forget everything, then?

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:57.800
All the yelling, all the anger...

00:20:57.800 --> 00:20:59.540
I can poison you if you want!

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:02.150
<b>Nag</b>

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:06.040
Nag, nag, nag, nag, nag!
Nag, nag, nag, nag, nag, nag, nag!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:04.680
<i>By the way, at the time,
Mogami-kun's sister was...</i>

00:21:02.670 --> 00:21:04.170
<b>Nag</b>

00:21:03.670 --> 00:21:04.680
<b>Nag</b>

00:21:04.680 --> 00:21:05.680
<b>Nag</b>

00:21:05.180 --> 00:21:06.030
<b>Nag</b>

00:21:05.680 --> 00:21:06.030
<b>Yell</b>

00:22:36.760 --> 00:22:42.060
Too many people use the word
"angel" as a generic complement.

00:22:42.610 --> 00:22:44.430
You aren't angels.

00:22:44.430 --> 00:22:48.040
The only angel is Miguel.

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:51.880
P-People sometimes tell me I'm an angel.

00:22:51.880 --> 00:22:53.430
<i>You're not supposed to say that yourself.</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:57.240
But it's absurd for a grim reaper like
me to call himself an angel, right?

00:22:57.240 --> 00:22:58.760
I wish I could disappear.

00:22:59.080 --> 00:23:02.730
The only real angel is Koyukichi-dono.

00:23:02.730 --> 00:23:07.610
No, he's less a messenger of god
 and more a bodhisattva.

00:23:03.050 --> 00:23:07.610
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:23:08.450 --> 00:23:09.950
<i>Bodhisattva!</i>

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:12.120
Maybe he's more like a god.

00:23:12.120 --> 00:23:13.310
I'm a god!

00:23:13.310 --> 00:23:15.690
The only god is Utsugi-sama.

00:23:15.690 --> 00:23:18.200
Sumiso-san is my goddess!
An archangel!

00:23:18.200 --> 00:23:20.330
Did you give up on yelling
at people, Seri-kun?

00:23:20.330 --> 00:23:25.040
Sorry! Sorry! Sorry! Sorry!

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Composite Processing Test</b>

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:28.410
Impossible! How are we getting
moe characters out of this?

00:23:29.080 --> 00:23:31.960
What happened to my chief
animation director supervisor?!

